    "title": "Wyoming leaders decry killing of Turning Point USA co-founder Charlie Kirk",
    "text": "Wyoming politicians condemned political violence after Charlie Kirk, a prolific organizer of conservative youth, was shot and killed Wednesday in Utah.\nKirk, 31, was speaking at a \"Prove Me Wrong\" debate hosted by his youth organization, Turning Point USA, on the Utah Valley University campus in Orem, Utah. It was the first stop of his American Comeback Tour on campuses across the U.S., scheduled to run until the end of October. In April, Kirk drew a sold-out crowd of 1,800 students at the University of Wyoming.",
